{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"d763cbf2-b83e-4c8d-9f01-d83d24581cac":{"type":"background-image-text","settings":{"subtitle":"CANADA'S LEADER IN","title":"COMMERCIAL MATS","text":"<p>A leader when it comes to outfitting commercial facilities in Canada, we have every mat you could possibly need. whether it’s for your entrance, lobby, warehouse, commercial kitchen, or office, we have you covered for all matting needs.<\/p>","button_label":"View ALL Mats for Entrances","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/commercial-entrance-mats","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Commercial_mats_1_c53c2f0a-db85-4e1b-9612-3e55c243dd29.jpg","focal_point":"center","layout":"right","height":550,"framed":false,"parallax":true,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"d79a48a1-5e43-433e-948d-b8c74148a179":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"MATS FOR THE ENTRANCE","home_featured_products":"cm-viper-entrance-mats","per_row":5,"rows":1,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":false,"divider":false}},"7823d741-cd31-4fec-9891-d902d62e016a":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Anti_Fatigue_mats_4ba17a34-79b9-45e8-a9ca-f24e8fdb86fe.jpg","image_width":550,"subtitle":"KEEP YOUR STAFF HEALTHY AND SAFE","title":"SAFETY & ANTI-FATIGUE MATS","text":"<p>Our mats provide relief from long days of standing still on cold hard floors, traction, anti-slip drainage, and numerous other benefits in all kinds of warehouses and production facilities.<\/p><p>Prioritize safety and provide a break from constricted blood flow to the legs in your facility with our anti-fatigue\/safety mats and runners.<\/p><p><\/p>","button_label":"View all Safety\/Anti-Fatigue Mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/safety-anti-fatigue-mats","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"49b77fab-7587-42bf-9407-9e93996b79cb":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Kitc